  "limitations": [
    "Only two held-out ResNet-50 layers are evaluated concurrently.",
    "Offline group profiles allocate layer-level Timeloop measurements using logical access proxies.",
    "Metadata group profiles use calibration medians and a nominal 16 logical-operations-per-cycle rate.",
    "Cross-combinations of profile source and scale source are normalization ablations, not independently optimized calibrations.",
    "The comparison changes both bandwidth and reference-cycle estimates.",
    "Causal phase-aware scheduling uses only the current group profile, classifies its estimated bottleneck on a balanced reference, and applies chiplet resource affinity; it does not inspect future groups.",
    "Oracle phase-aware scheduling accesses future group profiles.",
    "The simulator is an abstract scheduling model, not a cycle-accurate hardware implementation.",
    "No layer transition occurs in these single-layer workloads, so remapping overhead is not exercised."
